{{!-- ── SETUP BLOCKS ────────────────────────────────────────────
  Order in the markup = order on the page. Each block: what you get,
  set it up (ordered tasks + articles), watch out for, done when.
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── --}}
<div class="rm-onboard-steps" id="rm-onboard-blocks">

  {{!-- PLATFORM (always) --}}
  <section class="rm-onboard-step" id="rm-block-platform" data-rm-block="platform" data-rm-label="Platform">
    <div class="rm-onboard-step__inner">
      <div class="rm-onboard-step__meta">
        <span class="rm-onboard-step__num">01</span>
        <span class="rm-onboard-step__tag">Every workspace</span>
      </div>
      <div class="rm-onboard-step__body">
        <h2 class="rm-onboard-step__title">Platform: set up your workspace</h2>
        <span class="rm-onboard-plan-badge">Rentman Platform</span>
        <p class="rm-onboard-step__desc">The Rentman Platform is part of every plan. It holds your company settings, users, contacts, crew members and projects. Set it up first, because every product builds on it.</p>

        <p class="rm-onboard-step__res-label">Set it up</p>
        <ol class="rm-onboard-tasks">
          <li class="rm-onboard-task">
            <p class="rm-onboard-task__title">Empty your trial database before you add your own data.</p>
            <ul class="rm-onboard-task__links">
              <li><a href="https://support.rentman.io/hc/en-us/articles/360013982380-Empty-Your-Trial-Database">Empty Your Trial Database</a></li>
            </ul>
          </li>
          <li class="rm-onboard-task">
            <p class="rm-onboard-task__title">Add your company details and logo.</p>
            <ul class="rm-onboard-task__links">
              <li><a href="https://support.rentman.io/hc/en-us/articles/360014055700-Add-Company-Logo-and-Information-on-My-Documents">Add Company Logo and Information on My Documents</a></li>
            </ul>
          </li>
          <li class="rm-onboard-task">
            <p class="rm-onboard-task__title">Set up user roles, then invite your colleagues.</p>
            <ul class="rm-onboard-task__links">
              <li><a href="https://support.rentman.io/hc/en-us/articles/360012611160-Setting-Up-User-Roles">Setting Up User Roles</a></li>
              <li><a href="https://support.rentman.io/hc/en-us/articles/22185539659666-User-Role-Permissions-in-Rentman">User Role Permissions in Rentman</a></li>
              <li><a href="https://support.rentman.io/hc/en-us/articles/360015898239-Managing-Power-Users">Managing Power Users</a></li>
            </ul>
          </li>
          <li class="rm-onboard-task">
            <p class="rm-onboard-task__title">Set your email sender address and verify your domain.</p>
            <ul class="rm-onboard-task__links">
              <li><a href="https://support.rentman.io/hc/en-us/articles/360015717380-Change-the-Email-Sender-Address-and-Verify-a-Domain">Change the Email Sender Address and Verify a Domain</a></li>
            </ul>
          </li>
          <li class="rm-onboard-task">
            <p class="rm-onboard-task__title">Import your contacts and add your crew members.</p>
            <ul class="rm-onboard-task__links">
              <li><a href="https://support.rentman.io/hc/en-us/articles/360013553000-Import-your-Contacts">Import your Contacts</a></li>
              <li><a href="https://support.rentman.io/hc/en-us/articles/360014366299-Import-Your-Crew-Members">Import Your Crew Members</a></li>
            </ul>
          </li>
          <li class="rm-onboard-task">
            <p class="rm-onboard-task__title">Set up your document templates.</p>
            <ul class="rm-onboard-task__links">
              <li><a href="https://support.rentman.io/hc/en-us/articles/23413689614226-The-Document-Template-Library">The Document Template Library</a></li>
              <li><a href="https://support.rentman.io/hc/en-us/articles/360014232559-Customize-Document-Templates">Customize Document Templates</a></li>
              <li><a href="https://support.rentman.io/hc/en-us/articles/17707866444178-Variables-and-How-They-Work">Variables and How They Work</a></li>
            </ul>
          </li>
          <li class="rm-onboard-task">
            <p class="rm-onboard-task__title">Create project templates for the work you repeat.</p>
            <ul class="rm-onboard-task__links">
              <li><a href="https://support.rentman.io/hc/en-us/articles/360013367659-Project-Templates">Project Templates</a></li>
            </ul>
          </li>
          <li class="rm-onboard-task">
            <p class="rm-onboard-task__title">Create your first project.</p>
            <ul class="rm-onboard-task__links">
              <li data-rm-show="inventory&amp;crew"><a href="https://support.rentman.io/hc/en-us/articles/14829964454546-Create-Basic-Rental-Project-Crew-and-Equipment">Create Basic Rental Project (Crew and Equipment)</a></li>
              <li data-rm-show="inventory&amp;!crew"><a href="https://support.rentman.io/hc/en-us/articles/13793720770194-Create-an-Equipment-only-Project">Create an Equipment-only Project</a></li>
              <li data-rm-show="crew&amp;!inventory"><a href="https://support.rentman.io/hc/en-us/articles/13724369155218-Create-a-Crew-only-Project">Create a Crew-only Project</a></li>
              <li><a href="https://support.rentman.io/hc/en-us/articles/360013590720-Create-or-Duplicate-a-Project">Create or Duplicate a Project</a></li>
            </ul>
          </li>
        </ol>

        <div class="rm-onboard-step__tip">
          <span class="rm-onboard-step__tip-label">Watch out for</span>
          <p>Start from the <strong>Document Template Library</strong> instead of building a template from scratch. Your quotes, invoices and packing slips all use these templates.</p>
        </div>


        <div class="rm-onboard-step__video">
          <a href="https://support.rentman.io/hc/en-us/articles/360015575940-Video-Introduction-to-creating-managing-your-projects" class="rm-onboard-video-link">
            <span class="rm-onboard-video-link__play" aria-hidden="true">▶</span>
            Video: Introduction to creating and managing your projects
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {{!-- INVENTORY --}}
  <section class="rm-onboard-step" id="rm-block-inventory" data-rm-block="inventory" data-rm-label="Inventory">
    <div class="rm-onboard-step__inner">
      <div class="rm-onboard-step__meta">
        <span class="rm-onboard-step__num">02</span>
        <span class="rm-onboard-step__tag">Product</span>
      </div>
      <div class="rm-onboard-step__body">
        <h2 class="rm-onboard-step__title">Inventory: add and plan your equipment</h2>
        <span class="rm-onboard-plan-badge">Inventory</span>
        <p class="rm-onboard-step__desc">Inventory adds the <strong>Equipment</strong>, <strong>Shortages</strong> and <strong>Maintenance</strong> modules, and the <em>Equipment</em> and <em>Subrent</em> tabs in your projects.</p>

        <p class="rm-onboard-step__res-label">Set it up</p>
        <ol class="rm-onboard-tasks">
          <li class="rm-onboard-task">
            <p class="rm-onboard-task__title">Decide which items are bulk and which are serialized, and which combinations you need.</p>
            <ul class="rm-onboard-task__links">
              <li><a href="https://support.rentman.io/hc/en-us/articles/24338169105298-Equipment-Import-How-do-I-Format-my-Import-File-for-Bulk-Equipment">Format your import file for bulk equipment</a></li>
              <li><a href="https://support.rentman.io/hc/en-us/articles/24320695034642-Equipment-Import-How-do-I-Format-my-Import-File-for-Serialized-Equipment">Format your import file for serialized equipment</a></li>
              <li><a href="https://support.rentman.io/hc/en-us/articles/19886981689362-Insights-into-Default-Actual-and-Planned-Content">Insights into Default, Actual and Planned Content</a></li>
            </ul>
          </li>
          <li class="rm-onboard-task">
            <p class="rm-onboard-task__title">Import your individual equipment items first.</p>
            <ul class="rm-onboard-task__links">
              <li><a href="https://support.rentman.io/hc/en-us/articles/360014141299-Import-Your-Equipment">Import Your Equipment</a></li>
            </ul>
          </li>
          <li class="rm-onboard-task">
            <p class="rm-onboard-task__title">Add your combinations, then import their default content.</p>
            <ul class="rm-onboard-task__links">
              <li><a href="https://support.rentman.io/hc/en-us/articles/20045646271250-Equipment-Import-Import-default-content">Equipment Import: Import default content</a></li>
            </ul>
          </li>
          <li class="rm-onboard-task">
            <p class="rm-onboard-task__title">Plan equipment on a project.</p>
            <ul class="rm-onboard-task__links">
              <li><a href="https://support.rentman.io/hc/en-us/articles/360013730520-Plan-Equipment-on-a-Project">Plan Equipment on a Project</a></li>
              <li><a href="https://support.rentman.io/hc/en-us/articles/360017700339-What-are-planning-and-usage-periods">What are planning and usage periods?</a></li>
            </ul>
          </li>
          <li class="rm-onboard-task">
            <p class="rm-onboard-task__title">Solve shortages, for example with a subrental.</p>
            <ul class="rm-onboard-task__links">
              <li><a href="https://support.rentman.io/hc/en-us/articles/360013836939-Guide-to-Solving-Equipment-Shortages">Guide to Solving Equipment Shortages</a></li>
              <li><a href="https://support.rentman.io/hc/en-us/articles/360013771040-Solve-Equipment-Shortages-with-Subrentals">Solve Equipment Shortages with Subrentals</a></li>
            </ul>
          </li>
        </ol>

        <div class="rm-onboard-step__tip">
          <span class="rm-onboard-step__tip-label">Watch out for</span>
          <p>A <strong>virtual combination</strong> cannot hold serialized equipment and has no QR code. If you need to know exactly which serial numbers go out, use a serialized <strong>physical combination</strong>. Import default content only after all your equipment is imported.</p>
        </div>


        <div class="rm-onboard-step__video">
          <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Fm_bmQDHPew" class="rm-onboard-video-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <span class="rm-onboard-video-link__play" aria-hidden="true">▶</span>
            Video: How to import your equipment into Rentman
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {{!-- CREW --}}
  <section class="rm-onboard-step" id="rm-block-crew" data-rm-block="crew" data-rm-label="Crew">
    <div class="rm-onboard-step__inner">
      <div class="rm-onboard-step__meta">
        <span class="rm-onboard-step__num">03</span>
        <span class="rm-onboard-step__tag">Product</span>
      </div>
      <div class="rm-onboard-step__body">
        <h2 class="rm-onboard-step__title">Crew: schedule your people</h2>
        <span class="rm-onboard-plan-badge">Crew</span>
        <p class="rm-onboard-step__desc">Crew adds the <strong>Crew planner</strong>, <strong>Vehicles</strong> and <strong>Time registration</strong> modules, and crew scheduling and transport planning in your projects.</p>

        <p class="rm-onboard-step__res-label">Set it up</p>
        <ol class="rm-onboard-tasks">
          <li class="rm-onboard-task">
            <p class="rm-onboard-task__title">Create functions for the roles you plan.</p>
            <ul class="rm-onboard-task__links">
              <li><a href="https://support.rentman.io/hc/en-us/articles/14232209807506-Functions-What-Are-They-and-How-to-Create-Them">Functions: What Are They and How to Create Them</a></li>
            </ul>
          </li>
          <li class="rm-onboard-task">
            <p class="rm-onboard-task__title">Set up your crew rates.</p>
            <ul class="rm-onboard-task__links">
              <li><a href="https://support.rentman.io/hc/en-us/articles/7191443180562-Crew-Rates-and-Overtime-Calculation">Crew Rates and Overtime Calculation</a></li>
            </ul>
          </li>
          <li class="rm-onboard-task">
            <p class="rm-onboard-task__title">Plan crew on a project.</p>
            <ul class="rm-onboard-task__links">
              <li><a href="https://support.rentman.io/hc/en-us/articles/360014594620-Plan-Crew-from-within-a-Project">Plan Crew from within a Project</a></li>
              <li><a href="https://support.rentman.io/hc/en-us/articles/360014610140-Crew-Planner-Module">Crew Planner Module</a></li>
            </ul>
          </li>
          <li class="rm-onboard-task">
            <p class="rm-onboard-task__title">Invite your crew and share the schedule.</p>
            <ul class="rm-onboard-task__links">
              <li><a href="https://support.rentman.io/hc/en-us/articles/17080436056978-Invite-Crew-Members-and-Invitation-Types">Invite Crew Members and Invitation Types</a></li>
              <li><a href="https://support.rentman.io/hc/en-us/articles/360014672919-Communicate-the-Crew-Planning-Schedule">Communicate the Crew Planning Schedule</a></li>
            </ul>
          </li>
          <li class="rm-onboard-task">
            <p class="rm-onboard-task__title">Set up time registration.</p>
            <ul class="rm-onboard-task__links">
              <li><a href="https://support.rentman.io/hc/en-us/articles/360015498439-Time-Registration-Module">Time Registration Module</a></li>
            </ul>
          </li>
        </ol>

        <div class="rm-onboard-step__tip">
          <span class="rm-onboard-step__tip-label">Watch out for</span>
          <p>Crew rates cannot be imported. Enter them in the <strong>Configuration module</strong> &gt; <em>Financial &gt; Crew rates</em>, and use <strong>Link rates</strong> to apply one rate to many crew members at once.</p>
        </div>


        <div class="rm-onboard-step__video">
          <a href="https://support.rentman.io/hc/en-us/articles/360015581499-Video-Introduction-to-planning-your-crew-and-transport" class="rm-onboard-video-link">
            <span class="rm-onboard-video-link__play" aria-hidden="true">▶</span>
            Video: Introduction to planning your crew and transport
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {{!-- QUOTING & INVOICING --}}
  <section class="rm-onboard-step" id="rm-block-qi" data-rm-block="qi" data-rm-label="Quoting &amp; Invoicing">
    <div class="rm-onboard-step__inner">
      <div class="rm-onboard-step__meta">
        <span class="rm-onboard-step__num">04</span>
        <span class="rm-onboard-step__tag">Add-on</span>
      </div>
      <div class="rm-onboard-step__body">
        <h2 class="rm-onboard-step__title">Quoting &amp; Invoicing: quote, invoice and get paid</h2>
        <span class="rm-onboard-plan-badge rm-onboard-plan-badge--addon">Quoting &amp; Invoicing add-on</span>
        <p class="rm-onboard-step__desc">Quoting &amp; Invoicing adds the <strong>Financial</strong> module and purchase orders to your projects. Your quotes and invoices use the document templates from the Platform block, so finish those first.</p>

        <p class="rm-onboard-step__res-label">Set it up</p>
        <ol class="rm-onboard-tasks">
          <li class="rm-onboard-task">
            <p class="rm-onboard-task__title">Set up your invoicing process.</p>
            <ul class="rm-onboard-task__links">
              <li><a href="https://support.rentman.io/hc/en-us/articles/360013628279-Set-Up-your-Invoicing-Process-and-Get-Paid">Set Up your Invoicing Process and Get Paid</a></li>
            </ul>
          </li>
          <li class="rm-onboard-task">
            <p class="rm-onboard-task__title">Create and send a quotation.</p>
            <ul class="rm-onboard-task__links">
              <li><a href="https://support.rentman.io/hc/en-us/articles/360012594659-Create-a-Quotation-or-a-Contract">Create a Quotation or a Contract</a></li>
            </ul>
          </li>
          <li class="rm-onboard-task">
            <p class="rm-onboard-task__title">Create an invoice and register the payment.</p>
            <ul class="rm-onboard-task__links">
              <li><a href="https://support.rentman.io/hc/en-us/articles/360013965120-Create-an-Invoice">Create an Invoice</a></li>
              <li><a href="https://support.rentman.io/hc/en-us/articles/18560784878610-Marking-an-Invoice-as-Paid">Marking an Invoice as Paid</a></li>
            </ul>
          </li>
          <li class="rm-onboard-task">
            <p class="rm-onboard-task__title">Connect your accounting software or online payments.</p>
            <ul class="rm-onboard-task__links">
              <li><a href="https://support.rentman.io/hc/en-us/articles/360013973240-Connect-your-Accounting-Software-to-Rentman">Connect your Accounting Software to Rentman</a></li>
